WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.154
Welcome to the wonderful world of Connie.

2
00:00:03.154 --> 00:00:10.488
In this short video, we'll look at a brand-new feature that came highly requested, straight from staff agents like you.

3
00:00:10.488 --> 00:00:12.945
It's called Task Alerts.

4
00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:16.925
We know Connie is just one of the many hats you wear in a day.

5
00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:22.207
You're logged in and ready to help, but you're also juggling everything else on your plate.

6
00:00:22.207 --> 00:00:24.690
The worry is always the same.

7
00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:29.561
What if a task comes in and I miss it because I'm heads-down on something else?

8
00:00:29.561 --> 00:00:32.534
Task Alerts puts that worry to rest.

9
00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:42.049
As long as you're logged in to Connie, a friendly notification pops up the moment a new task arrives, even when Connie isn't the window you're looking at.

10
00:00:42.049 --> 00:00:46.648
Heads-down in your email, a spreadsheet, or another browser tab?

11
00:00:46.648 --> 00:00:50.163
Connie gives you a gentle tap on the shoulder.

12
00:00:50.163 --> 00:00:56.245
When the alert appears, just click it, and Connie brings you right to the task, ready to go.

13
00:00:56.245 --> 00:00:58.096
And you're in control.

14
00:00:58.096 --> 00:01:03.404
The very first time, your browser will ask if Connie can show you notifications.

15
00:01:03.404 --> 00:01:06.352
Click Allow, and you're all set.

16
00:01:06.352 --> 00:01:08.292
Want to adjust it later?

17
00:01:08.292 --> 00:01:11.124
It all lives in your Chrome settings.

18
00:01:11.124 --> 00:01:19.827
Click the icon to the left of the web address, open Site settings, and you can turn notifications on or off for Connie any time you like.

19
00:01:19.827 --> 00:01:25.625
So stay focused on everything else you do, and let Connie keep an eye on your tasks for you.

20
00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:29.334
Just like that, nothing falls through the cracks.

21
00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:31.339
Thanks for using Connie.

22
00:01:31.339 --> 00:01:34.272
We can't wait to see all the amazing things you do with it.

